  DisplayName: The Court Goes into Mourning
  EventType: 1
  Description: The court {has gone|will go} into mourning for a royal prince, and
    society {has put|will put} away its colours for the season. Balls {are cancelled|will
    be cancelled}, and collectors {put off|will put off} buying jewels, old silks
    and plate until the court is out of black.
